 and [made] rivers and roads, that you may be guided,","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"16:16","t":"And landmarks. And by the stars they are [also] guided.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"16:17","t":"Then is He who creates like one who does not create? So will you not be reminded?","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"16:18","t":"And if you should count the favors of Allāh, you could not enumerate them. Indeed, Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"16:19","t":"And Allāh knows what you conceal and what you declare.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"16:20","t":"And those they invoke other than Allāh create nothing, and they [themselves] are created.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"16:21","t":"They are [in fact] dead, not alive, and they do not perceive when they will be resurrected.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"16:22","t":"Your god is one God. But those who do not believe in the Hereafter - their hearts are disapproving, and they are arrogant.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"16:23","t":"Assuredly, Allāh knows what they conceal and what they declare. Indeed, He does not like the arrogant.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"16:24","t":"And when it is said to them, \"What has your Lord sent down?\" they say, \"Legends of the former peoples,\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"16:25","t":"That they may bear their own burdens [i.e., sins] in full on the Day of Resurrection and some of the burdens of those whom they misguide without [i.e., by lack of] knowledge. Unquestionably, evil is that which they bear.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"16:26","t":"Those before them had already plotted, but Allāh came at [i.e., uprooted] their building from the foundations, so the roof fell upon them from above them, and the punishment came to them from where they did not perceive.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":26,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":27,"surahs":[16],"sajdah":false}